Supply Chain Incidences Catalogue
==================================

This catalogue includes the OSC&R technique corpus originally developed
by the PBOM / OSC&R project:

    https://github.com/pbom-dev/OSCAR

Original contributors include (among others) rubtoa, maxiozer,
secvladimir, NaorPenso, vaq130, and 6mile. See the Git history of
pbom-dev/OSCAR for the full author list.

OSC&R is one part of this catalogue. The catalogue is not a continuation
of the OSCAR project, and it is not an official pbom-dev release.
Attribution to the original authors is required for the OSC&R content;
claiming original authorship of that content is not permitted.

